    "body": "Looks already fixed on upstream/main 17a8c6e7: a_clamp_in_the_cleared_stock_margin_is_verified_and_blocks_post passes without a production change. Suggest closing; the maintainer decides.\n\nThe test places a tagged clamp on a cutting move in the expanded stock margin. Generation reports FixtureHit. The verification gate reports the fixture strike. Posting refuses and writes no NC file. The unclamped control posts successfully.\n\nRan cargo test -p camcraft-app --test pocket3d_margin_fixture: 1 passed, 0 failed. The existing fixture mesh law came from commit 42da336f. PR #1780 added the expanded stock margin.\n\nThis issue requests missing coverage. The new pin is not committed or published. I stopped because the worker instructions require stopping when the initial pin passes. The local pin remains in .claude/worktrees/issue-1850/crates/app/tests/pocket3d_margin_fixture.rs. The run log is /tmp/issue-1850-pin.log. No mutation or quick gate ran. Claim released.\n",
